Note on Linked Runtime Libraries & Third-Party Notices:
The compiled .g3a binaries in this repository link against open-source SDK
libraries for Casio fx-CG50 (gint, fxlibc, OpenLibm, libfxcg, and libgcc).
Please see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for their respective copyright notices,
licenses, and community attributions, which must be retained alongside binary
redistributions.

Directory- and component-specific terms:
- Utilities is a GPL-licensed fork in the separate repository
  https://github.com/id-worker/Utilities; see its LICENSE and PATCHNOTES.md.
- PythonExtra is in the separate repository
  https://github.com/id-worker/PythonExtra-4.0-beta-FX-CG50. Its upstream
  PythonExtra and MicroPython use MIT; linked components can have other terms.
- Translator/TDIC.DAT is dictionary data with separate terms and attribution
  questions; see Translator/LICENSE_DATA.txt and
  Translator/PUBLICATION_REVIEW_RU.md.
- Third-party code, libraries and assets retain their own terms. Unresolved
  provenance is documented in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and project notices.
